Wrote /opt/dlami/nvme/andrew-ggma/ggma/safety/vendor/MANIFEST.json
Data is git-ignored by design — re-run this script instead of committing it.
MANIFEST.json IS tracked: `git diff` it. A change there means the data changed, which means every downstream number changed. Commit it deliberately.

--- sorrybench ---
SORRY-Bench is GATED (HTTP 401) and cannot be fetched automatically.
No HuggingFace token was found.

To enable it:
  1. Visit https://huggingface.co/datasets/sorry-bench/sorry-bench-202503 while logged in
     and accept the SORRY-Bench Dataset License Agreement
     (it asks for Name, Affiliation, Email, Country, Purpose).
  2. Ensure a token is available: `huggingface-cli login`, or export HF_TOKEN.
  3. Re-run: python fetch_datasets.py --only sorrybench

Do NOT source this from an ungated mirror: the dataset licence forbids
redistribution, so mirrors are violations, and every known mirror carries the
superseded 202406 release with an incompatible category numbering.
Everything else fetches fine without this — see DATASET_SOURCES.md.


